{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_title", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_synopsis", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "f1c9588412e24070ddfc68ec70c31899ce06b34ed932be649497ba309723b35a", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん、見つけました♪\nここにいたんですね、探してたんですよ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，找到你了♪\n原来你在这啊，我找你好久了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "79a304d738bcf714b605c14e50ef281361940dc2a2b45c09b5bf6e62be622739", "ja": "すみません青羽さん、ちょっと席外してました。\nどうかしたんですか？", "zh": "抱歉，青羽小姐，我刚刚有事离席一下。\n请问有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "f00b5e077b8504c12ccd4076fcd69a6a0a226fe8d87e5182eac003e60596452e", "ja": "とっても大事なお話があるって、\n社長さんから連絡があったんです。", "zh": "社长那边有连络，\n说有非常重要的事情要找你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "5b01173e4a1cf813e2d188dc7803eca7dae52e1010b98f06bd4cb27da7469412", "ja": "大事な話ですか？　わかりました。\nこれから事務所に顔を出してみます。", "zh": "重要的事情吗？我明白了。\n我这就去事务所看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "dbd79dc2f9fe389b9bfd3d33826eeaafdc10a4cb17ebc6fad55db316c61c86cb", "ja": "私でお手伝いできることがあったら、遠慮しないで\n言ってくださいね！　では、いってらっしゃーい♪", "zh": "如果有什么需要我帮忙的，用不着客气，\n尽管跟我说唷！路上小心～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "f84777c00b49a63cba9eabb02d896ef4cb4168ec4c1046bcd3ed151424f75256", "ja": "……あ、それから！　もし音無先輩に会ったら、\nCDは今度返しますって伝えてください～！", "zh": "……啊，还有一件事！要是有看到音无前辈，\n帮我跟她说CD下次再还她～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1006_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1007_101kot", "source_sha256": "624c75d345cc5c9a2fc6f6deb77c2667099b48258e9d627f9738c215f94328fd", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9a8ff3b20c7eed80c40908b0531f2a40830fd0d0cc62d637a0eb9cac3dd23883", "ja": "音無さん、お疲れさまです！\nあれ？　社長はどこに……？", "zh": "音无小姐，你辛苦了！\n奇怪？社长人呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a69714aded8d9a0e2d957b51757f4697e8615b78c12f8601d10b7924b41166b1", "ja": "あっ、そうそう。青羽さんから伝言で、\nCDは今度返します、だそうですよ。", "zh": "啊，对了对了，青羽小姐要我跟你说，\nCD下次再还给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1010_101kot", "source_sha256": "9cd711e90b5da35235fd381cd7567b7369db3b93f69f765d01bc1120dc9e97f6", "ja": "えっ！？　み、美咲ちゃんったら、\nまさかあのCDの話をプロデューサーさんにっ！？", "zh": "咦！？美、美咲也真是的，\n难道她把那片CD的内容跟制作人先生说了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "a071636412f5ae1fe23352e358a108350b93ebad3d2db61adb93565f525d3cbb", "ja": "違うんです！　あれは別に私がそういう趣味とかじゃ\nなく、美咲ちゃんが好きなジャンルかな～とか思って！", "zh": "你不要误会！那个不是我的兴趣，\n我只是觉得美咲会喜欢那种类型才找给她的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2d91d4d7ca5a44e0233b2f3502f1719b2b09cc284762a630c98324553326b020", "ja": "あ、いえ、俺は伝言を頼まれただけで、\nCDの詳細は、きいていないんですけど……。", "zh": "呃，不，我就只是帮她传个话而已，\n并没有听她说那片CD的内容是什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "085912d5309ea3c9453b6ba1147d4578822ac997bc423c8ac2fd3f68ee7bbe38", "ja": "ああっ、そ、そうなんですか！？　すみません、\n今の話は忘れてください。どうか、記憶の彼方に……。", "zh": "啊！这、这样啊！？不好意思，\n请你忘了刚才的对话，把它抛到记忆的另一端吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "21582e317cd5d239d91d5ffe78fb19b5b56456ce32c167b1aeb59e1bf27258d9", "ja": "わ、わかりました。善処してみます。", "zh": "我、我明白了，我会尽量忘记。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "cf6a9320d0f072b3d74cb8361bcd4937438b93d1e5e345f5ed71eca53934c282", "ja": "ところで、大事な話があると聞いて\n飛んできたんですが……社長はどちらですか？", "zh": "话说回来，我是听说有重要的事情\n才火速赶过来的……请问社长人在哪呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "c3b257c3c6138fee6e32ca74eff95fd14257668ae9721bcf20195764212909d9", "ja": "えっ？　社長でしたら、{$P$}さんの\n後ろに、さっきからずっと立っていますけど……。", "zh": "咦？要找社长的话，他从刚刚就一直\n站在{$P$}先生的后面……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "5b624fe9b9591afacdcb302e38631b56f11e03e941c7f5e2b4e3ac0c2d91d487", "ja": "やあ、君！　私はここだよ！", "zh": "嗨！我就在这喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "8250c322c364158445cf2fae033fa4d2851eb30a148718cf0d3d3523c1f1e9da", "ja": "うわ、いつの間に！？\n日焼けがすごくて、暗がりと同化していますね……。", "zh": "哇，社长你什么时候出现的！？\n整个人晒得好黑，跟黑暗合为一体了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "7d39958d0be84bafea971e2418aeafd2e68a5125e5aa7ee56cfa012d46dd0c88", "ja": "はっはっは！\nいやあ、そんなにほめないでくれたまえ！", "zh": "哈哈哈！\n哎呀，别这么夸我嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "8b1c1f01e3a3c2073d87d8b1412eb683576a83b1b603fc91077d84862dfa332f", "ja": "特にほめてはいないと思いますよ、社長。\nそれより本題をお願いしますね！", "zh": "人家应该不是在夸你才对，社长。\n还是请你快点说正事吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "b73767221a6a69bf3908c52fc80822a8cc894fb6d513b656497c15a3809fc430", "ja": "あぁ、そうだったな。劇場の業務で忙しいのに、\n急に呼び出してしまって悪かったね。", "zh": "啊，说得也是。你剧场的工作这么忙，\n突然把你叫过来真是不好意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "e8f670876957281d6f284368f1cd4967cdb605d5815e0a371ca0f1a088d68395", "ja": "前回の君たちの公演は実にすばらしかった。\n君の手腕のおかげで、劇場の評判もうなぎのぼりだね！", "zh": "你们先前的公演实在太精采了，\n托你高明的经营手法，剧场的评价也是扶摇直上啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "a0d5f4b707da00d234570515bb095f89db87afb2bb6934322d0a228b6583db07", "ja": "ありがとうございます。実際に頑張ったのは\nアイドル達ですが、俺も手ごたえを感じました！", "zh": "谢谢社长的夸奖。实际上仍要归功于偶像们的努力，\n不过我也开始抓到诀窍了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "76bae0370363f095635c7109f6cfdeca663981d5d0bf9f66b4ebc9e7c9214766", "ja": "だがしかし！　高い評価を得たからといって、\nここで守りに入ってしまっては駄目だ！", "zh": "但是呢！即便获得好评，\n我们也不能在这时转为守成！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "61af8690ce4d50592c2b9bc80c2db8731b3d485400c265ba15a6bfcae5981469", "ja": "今の評価に満足せず、新たな一歩、更なる成長を\n求めて突き進む、攻めの姿勢を忘れてはいけない！", "zh": "我们不能甘于现在的评价，要踏出新的一步，\n向前追求更远大的成长，绝不可忘了积极进取的态度！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "deaaddee46a4cdfa417ec853c90e7781bd412cd71f4bde3cc7c5e3d948042466", "ja": "そこで、君にはまた新たなアイドルユニットを\nプロデュースしてもらいたい。引き受けてくれるかね？", "zh": "于是呢，我希望你继续培育新的偶像团体。\n你愿意接下这份工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_1027", "source_sha256": "1328858b72076382b4434a1d60241e572fa393e0e21d8022ddd6bd6bcd0ca477", "ja": "任せてください！", "zh": "请交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "cc9aa5ccc5a4cbbbb555f5de9280189d1adc0a3430f22637a70e0f3f53b27067", "ja": "もちろん、任せてください！\nアイドルをプロデュースするのが、俺の仕事です！", "zh": "这是当然，请交给我吧！\n培育偶像就是我的职责！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "003e9b325448c70d82db339f40520d867fc8b039faca8ac74ed476b15a9c8f1d", "ja": "うむ、いい返事だ！\n君はアイドルプロデューサーの鑑だな！", "zh": "嗯，多么响亮的回答！\n你真是偶像制作人的楷模啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_2002_president", "source_sha256": "5c6dfa7353806419cc947b35ea9db00b46e16ed0afc054a1ffb532d61a3e1fa4", "ja": "今回のメンバーは、馬場このみ君、佐竹美奈子君、\n木下ひなた君、中谷育君、そして、双海真美君。", "zh": "这次的成员是马场木实、佐竹美奈子、\n木下日向、中谷育以及双海真美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_2003_president", "source_sha256": "224ae617e6ca07c894170036a19d2e3a4526ca2c5b7b8d00992ce416ccfd118d", "ja": "この個性的な5人による革新的なアイドルユニット。\nその名も『ミックスナッツ』だ！", "zh": "由这独特的五人组成的创新偶像团体，\n其名为『Mix Nuts』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_2004_president", "source_sha256": "c949f6082fa2340185e3c609e00e73fa5e11eb1e4f8eb6214da473e0d0dcc46a", "ja": "メンバーの個性が、お互いの魅力を引き立て合い、\n高め合う。そんなユニットになってほしいと思ってね。", "zh": "让成员们的个性互相激发、衬托出彼此的魅力，\n这就是我希望你能打造出的团体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_2005_p", "source_sha256": "549bcccbe13a2579c02b935df52c25cbbabab8481a25aef9160bff72f0036b9d", "ja": "なるほど……。いい名前ですね！", "zh": "原来如此……真是个好名字呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_intro_2006_101kot", "source_sha256": "355958577f55ea39bf91194cb0bdfa9c7d94bd519c4101770101c19af021003f", "ja": "ゆうべ、おつまみに出されたナッツを見て、\nひらめいたそうですよ♪", "zh": "听说是社长昨晚看到下酒菜里的坚果，\n忽然灵光一闪想到的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
